{"path":"utility/variadic/va_end","title":"va_end","titleHtml":"va_end","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_end","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"The va_end macro performs cleanup for an ap object initialized by a call to va_start or va_copy. va_end may modify ap so that it is no longer usable.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/cstdarg\">&lt;cstdarg&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> va_end<span class=\"br0\">(</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"kw4\">va_list</span> ap <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>The <code>va_end</code> macro performs cleanup for an <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ap</span></code> object initialized by a call to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_start\">va_start</a></span> or <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_copy\">va_copy</a></span>. <code>va_end</code> may modify <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ap</span></code> so that it is no longer usable.\n</p><p>If there is no corresponding call to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_start\">va_start</a></span> or <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_copy\">va_copy</a></span>, or if <code>va_end</code> is not called before a function that calls <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_start\">va_start</a></span> or <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_copy\">va_copy</a></span> returns, the behavior is undefined.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> ap\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> an instance of the <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_list\">va_list</a></span> type to clean up\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Expanded_value\">Expanded value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_start\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>va_start</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  enables access to variadic function arguments <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function macro)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_copy\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>va_copy</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  makes a copy of the variadic function arguments <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function macro)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_arg\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>va_arg</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  accesses the next variadic function argument <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function macro)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/variadic/va_end\">C documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>va_end</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Expanded value","id":"Expanded_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/variadic","title":"Variadic functions"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"va_end","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. The va_end macro performs cleanup for an ap object initialized by a call to va_start or va_copy. va_end may modify ap…"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"ap"},{"label":"Expanded value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"va_start","note":"enables access to variadic function arguments"},{"label":"va_copy","note":"makes a copy of the variadic function arguments"},{"label":"va_arg","note":"accesses the next variadic function argument"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":116,"codeBlockCount":0}
